{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14306","headline":"奉和王侍郎春日喜李侍郎崔给谏张舍人韦谏议见访因命觞观乐之什 · 窦庠","name":"奉和王侍郎春日喜李侍郎崔给谏张舍人韦谏议见访因命觞观乐之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华馆迟嘉宾，逢迎淑景新。\n锦筵开绦帐，玉佩下朱轮。\n曲里三仙会，风前百啭春。\n欲知忘味处，共仰在齐人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦庠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14306.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14306","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}